# Everything in this repository is encrypted with git-crypt except what GitHub
# itself has to read: the profile README and its images, the workflows, the
# license and these git files. With the key unlocked it all reads normally;
# on GitHub and in a plain clone the rest is binary.
* filter=git-crypt diff=git-crypt
/README.md !filter !diff
/LICENSE !filter !diff
/.gitattributes !filter !diff
/.gitignore !filter !diff
.github/** !filter !diff
assets/** !filter !diff
